entries[268481] = { ["name"] = "Magister's Spell Bee Comb", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nSummons and dismisses the Magister's Spell Bee.\nRequires level 1 to 90 ( 90)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\"Teaches you how to summon the Breaker Bee. This mount changes depending on your Riding skill and location.\"\n\n\"A few Silvermoon Magisters once dedicated their arcane thesis to the study of infusing local flora with arcane-flecked pollen and the effects it had on pollinator species. To the Grand Magister, it was a success. To Silvermoon's Gardeners, it was not.\"\nVendor\n:Decor Duel" }
