entries[269640] = { ["name"] = "Sha-Warped Owl", ["text"] = "Binds when used\nUnique\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount changes depending on your Riding skill and location.\n\nSummons and dismisses this mount.\nRequires level 1 to 90 ( 90)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\"Sha has warped this owl into an even more fearsome creature. The emotions that flow through this creature make it an unmistakable harbinger of doom.\"\nPromotion" }
